{"id":"vod_sn_35872","vodId":"35872","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"传颂之物二人的白皇","name_cn":"传颂之物二人的白皇","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4b6fa7bfaa923383483e3f341b85d51c.jpg"},"summary":"“拜托你了，小安。”从皇帝驾崩开始的大和动乱。因毒杀大和皇女·安珠未遂而被追捕的右近卫大将·奥修特鲁。他在战斗的最后，耗尽了假面的力量，肉体和灵魂化为了世界的一部分。临别之际，把安珠和耐耐的未来托付给了朋友哈克。从奥斯特鲁那里得到了假面和意志的哈克，放弃了哈克的人生，对除了唯一知道事实的奈科内以外的所有人，选择了和面具一起作为奥斯特鲁的生活。然后逃到恩中卡伊，看到了恢复的征兆的安珠，想要取回父亲的皇帝留下的皇女的地位而站起来。另一方面，大和趁着混乱，八柱将的来光拥立伪皇女，企图掌握国家。不久大和军的进攻，波及到了为了排除真正的皇女而去的延中宫……。席卷大和全境的战乱，拉开了帷幕。“传颂之物”系列最终章。所有的谜团，现在被解开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":28,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tAdjJPnHmB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jeg3nYajrc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dFimSJFhBg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Lsa4NbiYWk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LYLjKkaWhA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nt9JKxsGDP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fRYRpWLy0g1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UWN4WWWYM21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4LKqWwxmHB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8VC1XGYegA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/akT6PDKNrU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6uPi8aF61D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G8irutZmLW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ELm4ZQ